# Responsive Design Rules

Every UI must work on:

- mobile 320px
- tablet 768px
- desktop 1440px


## Breakpoints

Use:

mobile:
<576px

tablet:
576-1024px

desktop:
>1024px


## Layout

Desktop:

sidebar + content


Mobile:

sidebar becomes:

- drawer
- hamburger menu


Tables:

Desktop:

normal table


Mobile:

convert rows into cards
or allow horizontal scrolling.


## CSS

Prefer:

CSS Grid
Flexbox
CSS variables


Avoid:

fixed widths


Bad:

width:900px;


Good:

width:100%;
max-width:1200px;


## Touch targets

Buttons:

minimum height:
40px

Mobile controls:

44px+
